  "label": "emaciated human bodies",
  "description": "Multiple bodies of severely malnourished individuals, likely Holocaust victims, are depicted. One body is suspended upside down by its feet from a wooden structure, with its head and upper torso visible. Another body lies partially covered by a blanket, with its face visible and showing extreme emaciation. Additional bodies are visible in the background, lying on the ground. The bodies are in a state of extreme suffering and death, with visible signs of starvation and trauma.",
